  "first_mid_change_minus_event mixes the recorder receipt clock and the source play clock; the S664 offset bounds recorder-vs-UTC only and is never applied as a correction",
  "book_moved_first compares two recorder-clock instants (book snapshot receipt vs state receipt); a change inside the window may belong to a later play (change_after_next_event)",
  "latency measurement of archived rows only; not a forecast and not a trading claim"
